OL,3,ACalifornia targets Nvidia in China AI  
OL,4,Achip probe                             
OL,6,FThe BBC has contacted Nvidia for       
OL,7,Fcomment.                               
OL,9,F"Nvidia is in a messy, transnational   
OL,10,Fsituation but the underlying principle 
OL,11,Fof our corporate securities law is     
OL,12,Fclear: Companies cannot mislead their  
OL,13,Finvestors," Bonta said on Thursday.    
